# Mode$ ManifestDread (ManifestDreadEffect.java:39, triggerhooks.go):
# Unnerving Grasp, with no target, manifests dread: of the top two the
# human manifests Grizzly Bears and puts Mountain into the graveyard, so
# Paranormal Analyst returns the Mountain to the hand.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets none
queue cardchoice 6
queue cardchoice 7
castspell human 1
resolvestack
resolvestack
